     1406   define variable vss-include-info11 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     1407   on help of frame Dialog-Frame
     1408   do:
     1409     run gbl/app_help.p
     1410       (input this-procedure :file-name
     1411       ,input ''
     1412       ,input ?
     1413       ) no-error.
     1414     if error-status :error then do:
     1415       message
